   "html": "<div layer-name=\"Study Notes\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--spacing-md);flex-shrink:0\">\n  <div layer-name=\"Note / What it shows\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--spacing-xs);padding:var(--spacing-md);flex-shrink:0;width:280px;background:var(--color-canvas-note-background);border:1px solid var(--color-canvas-note-border);border-radius:var(--radius-control)\">\n    <div layer-name=\"Note Title\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:var(--text-subheadline);font-weight:var(--font-weight-semibold);line-height:var(--leading-subheadline);color:var(--color-canvas-note-text)\">What it shows</div>\n    <div layer-name=\"Note Body\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:var(--text-subheadline);font-weight:var(--font-weight-regular);line-height:var(--leading-subheadline);color:var(--color-canvas-note-text)\">First stop with \"Set up by\" only (no drive) under a connector with no drive text yet (loading); \"Leave · park · set up by\"; \"walk-in unknown\"; an out-of-order line; the Overnight connector; an infeasible drive; the Evening blue hour window.</div>\n  </div>\n  <div layer-name=\"Note / Snapshot crop\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--spacing-xs);padding:var(--spacing-md);flex-shrink:0;width:280px;background:var(--color-canvas-note-background);border:1px solid var(--color-canvas-note-border);border-radius:var(--radius-control)\">\n    <div layer-name=\"Note Title\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:var(--text-subheadline);font-weight:var(--font-weight-semibold);line-height:var(--leading-subheadline);color:var(--color-canvas-note-text)\">Snapshot crop</div>\n    <div layer-name=\"Note Body\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:var(--text-subheadline);font-weight:var(--font-weight-regular);line-height:var(--leading-subheadline);color:var(--color-canvas-note-text)\">The snapshot is the same column cropped from a taller list. The first connector there is the rail alone: MapKit has not answered yet.</div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
